# Logs — never commit. Eval/rebaseline runs write *.log; a leaked key once rode an
# eval log into the public mirror. JSON corpus/result files below stay tracked.
*.log
eval/data/*.log

# Eval: large result files are committed intentionally (they are the evidence corpus)
# No exclusions needed here — all eval/data/*.json are tracked

# Eval-batch scratch data: raw per-run result JSONs + working writeups, not the
# committed evidence corpus above. Untracked by design, not an unlogged session —
# see CLAUDE.md "Working tree" and docs/progress.md sessions 36/40/44. Canonical
# findings docs get promoted and committed explicitly once reviewed (e.g. the four
# already-tracked eval/data/session36/*_session36.md publication files predate this
# rule and are unaffected by it).
eval/data/session36/

# Root-level one-off eval/rebaseline driver scripts — private scratch, never
# committed (see CLAUDE.md "Working tree").
/rebaseline_*.ps1
/eval_gemini_*.ps1

# Ad hoc local test artifacts at repo root (e.g. session-51 GID entrypoint test tarballs)
/*.tar

# Docker override file — machine-specific dev config (TLS proxy CA mount, custom
# GeoIP paths, test image pins). Each machine creates its own; never committed.
# See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md "Optional configuration" for the inline snippets.
docker-compose.override.yml

# Docker / model weights (never commit)
*.gguf
*.bin
*.safetensors
ollama-models/

# GeoIP databases (binary, large, not for git — download separately)
data/geoip/*.mmdb
data/geoip/*.mmdb.gz
geoip/*.mmdb
geoip/*.mmdb.gz

# Pip install artifacts
=1.0.0

# Claude Code session transcripts
2026-*.txt

# Validation results (runtime output — not source code)
validation_results/

# Runtime SQLite databases (created by the application at startup)
verdix.db
cache.db
